Cindy Enterprise Server
This repository contains an independent server implementation for clients using
the Cindy protocols.

The optional client build workflow produces artifacts from the Cindy client
source at https://github.com/makecindy/cindy, mirrored by the configured fork.
The Cindy client is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its source
revision is pinned in configs/client-build.json and its own notices are retained
inside the client build output.
